## 🚀 Installation and Execution

### Step 1: Clone the Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/dryashu8310-de/par.git
```

### Step 2: Open the Project

```bash
cd par
```

### Step 3: Configure MySQL

Create the database:

```sql
CREATE DATABASE smart_parking;
```

Configure your database username, password, and connection URL in the backend configuration.

### Step 4: Build the Backend

Open PowerShell inside the backend folder:

```bash
cd backend
```

Run:

```bash
mvn clean package
```

### Step 5: Deploy on Apache Tomcat

Copy the generated WAR file from:

```text
backend/target/smart-parking.war
```

Deploy it to the Tomcat `webapps` folder and start Tomcat.

### Step 6: Run the Application

Open your browser and access the application using the deployed Tomcat context path.

Example:

```text
http://localhost:8080/smart-parking/
```

The exact URL depends on your Tomcat deployment configuration.

## 🗄️ Database

